  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">שיחה בציורים – מסעי בני ישראל</span></span></h2><p data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"121\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">⛺ <strong data-end=\"135\" data-start=\"123\">סֻכּוֹת:</strong><br data-end=\"138\" data-start=\"135\" />\nבְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל חָנוּ בְּסֻכּוֹת בַּמִּדְבָּר.</span></p><p data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"188\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👦👧 <strong data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"193\">יְלָדִים </strong><span data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"193\">(עצובים)</span><strong data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"193\">:</strong><br data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"206\" />\nאַבָּא, מַדּוּעַ הַדֶּרֶךְ בַּמִּדְבָּר כָּל כָּךְ קָשָׁה? חַם וְיֵשׁ רַק חוֹל!</span></p><p data-end=\"511\" data-start=\"290\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👨‍🦱 <strong data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"296\">אָב&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(עונה)</span><span data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"296\" style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רְאוּ אֶת </span><strong data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"317\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">הַמָּן</strong><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"> שֶׁה' נוֹתֵן לָנוּ כָּל בֹּקֶר לֶאֱכוֹל 🍞.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רְאוּ אֶת </span><strong data-end=\"405\" data-start=\"384\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">עֲנָנֵי הַכָּבוֹד</strong><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"> שמגינים עֲלֵינוּ מֵהַחֹם ☁️.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהִנֵּה </span><strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"446\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַמּוּד הָאֵשׁ</strong><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"> בַּלַּיְלָה שֶׁמֵּאִיר לָנוּ אֶת הַדֶּרֶךְ 🔥.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"513\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🚶‍♂️🚶‍♀️ <strong data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"524\">הַמִּשְׁכָּן&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(נוסע)<b>:</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל מַמְשִׁיכִים בַּמִּדְבָּר.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"688\" data-start=\"596\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌴 <strong data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"599\">עֵינוֹת וּתְמָרִים&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(מנוחה)</span><span data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"599\" style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִגַּעְנוּ לְמָקוֹם שֶׁיֵּשׁ בּוֹ </span><strong data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"659\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">עֵינוֹת מַיִם וּתְמָרִים</strong><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"690\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌳&nbsp;<span data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"693\"><b>יָטְבָתָה&nbsp;</b></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(קרובים לארץ)</span><span data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"693\" style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>:<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עַכְשָׁו הִגַּעְנוּ לְ</span><strong data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"734\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">יָטְבָתָה</strong><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">, וְיֵשׁ בָּהּ מַיִם רַבִּים 💧.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"782\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍🦱 <strong data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"788\">אָב </strong><span data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"788\">(מַרְגִּיעַ)</span><strong data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"788\">:</strong><br data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"809\" />\nיְלָדַי הַיְּקָרִים, אַף שֶׁהַדֶּרֶךְ לֹא קַלָּה, ה' שׁוֹמֵר עָלֵינוּ, נוֹתֵן לָנוּ מָזוֹן, מַיִם וְהַגָּנָה עַד שֶׁנַּגִּיעַ&nbsp;לְאֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל.</span></p><p data-end=\"1106\" data-start=\"958\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🌊<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"962\">מַחֲנֶה אַחֲרוֹן </strong><span data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"962\">(מִמִּזְרַח לַיַּרְדֵּן)</span><strong data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"962\">:</strong><br data-end=\"1009\" data-start=\"1006\" />\nעַכְשָׁו אֲנַחְנוּ חוֹנִים בַּמַּחֲנֶה&nbsp;הָאַחֲרוֹן מֵעֵבֶר לַיַּרְדֵּן, מוּכָנִים לְהִכָּנֵס&nbsp;לָאָרֶץ.</span></span></p><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><p data-end=\"1230\" data-start=\"1108\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🕊️ <strong data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1112\">שָׁלוֹם:</strong><br data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1124\" />\nבְּקָרוֹב נַעֲבֹר אֶת הַיַּרְדֵּן עִם <strong data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"1165\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</strong>, לָבוֹא לְאֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּשִׂמְחָה וְאֱמוּנָה!</span></p><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;שמות החניות: מָרָה, אֵילִמָה, רְפִידִים, לִבְנָה, הַר שֶׁפֶר, יָטְבָתָה.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span>⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></div><p></p><br /><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlIregpiDSVVCkjvGpoXMhP4d1UDa6ZcoDnHahMSiI7YoI8l7NxjcVWNCWKdQubRV2Wvvicbtg1M80Lq29tU-5T4eZFGNX1mpA9v7pb3EF4PkSGoCQJ8lFKOVbEAI2r4C9ILB41keXAeC8nfB5CIz7wAFBL2sgw3RnHy85R2EL6JQAAcRkO0xtYFYwFRs/s469/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"458\" data-original-width=\"469\" height=\"312\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhlIregpiDSVVCkjvGpoXMhP4d1UDa6ZcoDnHahMSiI7YoI8l7NxjcVWNCWKdQubRV2Wvvicbtg1M80Lq29tU-5T4eZFGNX1mpA9v7pb3EF4PkSGoCQJ8lFKOVbEAI2r4C9ILB41keXAeC8nfB5CIz7wAFBL2sgw3RnHy85R2EL6JQAAcRkO0xtYFYwFRs/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /></div><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div><div><span><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></h2><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא?</span></h2></span></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><p></p></span></div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל יָצְאוּ מִמִּצְרַיִם בְּחַג הַסֻּכּוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַבָּנוֹת שֶׁל צְלָפְחָד הִתְחַתְּנוּ עִם בְּנֵי הַדּוֹדִים שֶׁלָּהֶן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּאֵילִם הָיוּ מַעַיְנוֹת וּתְמָרִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵאָלוּשׁ, הֵם נָסְעוּ לִרְפִידִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵרִתְמָה, הֵם נָסְעוּ לַחֲצֵרֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַהֲרֹן הַכֹּהֵן מֵת בְּהֹר הָהָר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִי שֶׁהָרַג בְּמֵזִיד - צָרִיךְ לִבְרֹחַ לְעִיר מִקְלָט?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיָּם הַגָּדוֹל הוּא הַגְּבוּל הַמִּזְרָחִי שֶׁל אֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בָּקִי בֶּן יָגְלִי הָיָה הַנָּשִׂיא שֶׁל שֵׁבֶט דָּן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַלְּוִיִּים קִבְּלוּ 100 עָרִים בְּאֶרֶץ יִשְׂרָאֵל?</span></li></ol>"
}
